      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.17,
      "end_seconds": 43.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.24,
      "end_seconds": 50.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.96,
      "end_seconds": 69.99,
      "duration_seconds": 19.03,
      "text": "when it starts I tend to get loose stools now and then as well the loose stools now and then? That's been for six months i mean, with loose stools now and then, it feels severe to me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.62,
      "end_seconds": 74.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Did you get weight loss or night-time diarrhoea?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.69,
      "end_seconds": 79.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.49,
      "end_seconds": 84.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "and what about vomiting or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.09,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.17,
      "end_seconds": 93.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.7,
      "end_seconds": 96.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.52,
      "end_seconds": 117.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.12,
      "end_seconds": 122.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "So, no, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.74,
      "end_seconds": 134.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.74,
      "end_seconds": 146.9,
      "duration_seconds": 11.16,
      "text": "I retired from the post office two years ago. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.34,
      "end_seconds": 151.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.58,
      "end_seconds": 156.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Let me think, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.85,
      "end_seconds": 165.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.41,
      "end_seconds": 169.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Well, not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.42,
      "end_seconds": 174.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.29,
      "end_seconds": 178.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.68,
      "end_seconds": 185.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.29,
      "end_seconds": 199.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.81,
      "end_seconds": 215.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.89,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 110 over 81, heart rate 79, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.98,
      "end_seconds": 222.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.1,
      "end_seconds": 227.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Okay, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.09,
      "end_seconds": 250.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender, and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.69,
      "end_seconds": 261.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.06,
      "end_seconds": 275.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.32,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Let me tell you where I've got to. It fits best with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.13,
      "end_seconds": 291.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I think a coeliac blood test makes sense here, for bloating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.62,
      "end_seconds": 295.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "So, okay, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.06,
      "end_seconds": 299.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.84,
      "end_seconds": 305.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
